  "title": "Cinnamon and Ginger Caramelized Pumpkin Seeds",
  "description": "Save your pumpkin seeds, toss them in a buttery cinnamon and ginger mixture, and bake into sweet and spicy pumpkin seeds for Halloween!",
  "authors": [
